","text":"Policy Brief"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem","Background","Evidence","Legal / Policy Framework","Key Findings","Policy Options","Recommendation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful Outputs"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policy briefs"},{"text":"Country reports"},{"text":"Legal memoranda"},{"text":"Research papers"},{"text":"Situation reports"},{"text":"Advocacy notes"},{"text":"Programme reports"},{"text":"Human rights assessments"}]}]},{"heading":"Diplomatic & International Communication","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"International work requires more than legal knowledge."},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Professional writing"},{"text":"Diplomatic communication"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Stakeholder management"},{"text":"Cross-cultural communication"},{"text":"Public speaking"},{"text":"Presentation skills"},{"text":"Conflict sensitivity"},{"text":"Interdisciplinary collaboration"},{"text":"The ability to write clearly for a non-lawyer audience is especially valuable."}]}]},{"heading":"Language Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Language capability can significantly strengthen international careers."},{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"p","text":"Professional English"},{"type":"h","text":"Valuable Additional Languages"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on career geography:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"French"},{"text":"Spanish"},{"text":"Arabic"},{"text":"Russian"},{"text":"Chinese"},{"text":"Portuguese"},{"text":"A student should ideally develop one additional international working language rather than learning several languages superficially."}]}]},{"heading":"Technology & Digital Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Modern international organizations increasingly use data and digital systems."},{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microsoft Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Word"},{"text":"Google Workspace"},{"text":"Digita